<title>PERU: Buenaventura sets dividend.</title>
<headline>Buenaventura sets dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peruvian miner Buenaventura set a dividend of 0.12 sol per share based on 1996 profits, according to the Lima Stock Excchange.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 10, record April 4, the bolsa said in its daily report.</p>
<p>Buenaventura's total dividend payment will be 16.5 million soles.</p>
<p>((--Lima Newsroom, 511-221-2134))</p>
